THE GRAMMAR CLOSES WHAT THE HOST LEAVES OPEN. The conditional below never reaches an `<%endif%>`,
and the host records `unterminated-conditional` and recovers to the end of the source. The grammar
bleeds nothing past this file, so nothing here stands degenerate — the divergence lives in what a
reader gets TOLD, which `tools/recovery-witness.js` measures and no colour reveals.

